cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, together with the article it accompanies."
type: software
title: "Hidden-trapping and suspected-crushing detection for piglets: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebook, preprocessing scripts and annotation tools for the manuscript
  "Detecting hidden piglet trapping from temporal changes in visible piglet counts in
  farrowing-pen video: An offline proof-of-concept study" (PLOS ONE, revised version of
  PONE-D-26-22779). The data needed to reproduce the results are archived separately on Zenodo.
